ly version of Unix was born.\nKen Thompson作のようです。さらに `qed` が前身として存在していたとのこと。\n\u0026gt; In the meanwhile, the concept of ed didn’t come from scratch, it is inspired by an earlier text editor, qed.","ts":"1635483266.051600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Medium: Why Ed Is the Standard Text Editor?","id":1,"title":"Why Ed Is the Standard Text Editor?","title_link":"https://levelup.gitconnected.com/why-ed-is-the-standard-text-editor-bf45f8f21a3a","text":"If you visit Rob Pike’s homepage on Twitter, you may notice that his bio contains only one sentence: Ed Is the Standard Text Editor.","image_url":"https://miro.medium.com/max/1200/1*M1I9Qc5Jlv7DtvIUrieWpw.jpeg","fields":[{"title":"Reading time","value":"6 min read","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1606285738,"service_name":"Medium","service_icon":"https://miro.medium.com/fit/c/152/152/1*sHhtYhaCe2Uc3IU0IgKwIQ.png","from_url":"https://levelup.gitconnected.com/why-ed-is-the-standard-text-editor-bf45f8f21a3a","original_url":"https://levelup.gitconnected.com/why-ed-is-the-standard-text-editor-bf45f8f21a3a"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NG5i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eabf48ad-0ff7-47b1-a221-b5a15277a8fe","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最新のLSPを使えば最新のIDEで開発するのと同じ[要出典]","ts":"1635482237.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q0x4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87ebb83e-2d12-4030-abdf-9c0ab6a187e5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"IDE は IDE で専用のリファクタリング機能とか強いですからね。便利だと思います(使ってはいないですが)","ts":"1635481332.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h42"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8210558c-0356-4b80-bde4-1d3cd896cc54","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"まあ会社によってはIDE指定されてたりするところ普通にありますね。\n~(そしてIDEターミナルからVim起動)~","ts":"1635481121.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_