X/3O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5f409b1-b2d3-4b82-81db-5f21e6b19aef","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Mと∞のアレだっていう印象なんだけども。","ts":"1635475808.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fub/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcfa1930-1ba3-400c-a737-f7969ce24816","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なにか単純な数式で表される曲線なら、まあかぶることはあるでしょうね。\nリサージュ曲線に似ているかな？","ts":"1635475759.024200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ad3o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"900c9fdc-5886-48e1-8d62-8c0cc0f624bf","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"Visual Studioかなにかを思い出した","ts":"1635475698.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u8E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f604b0a-8b39-4bab-8e91-d25877ebf663","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"意匠としてはあるあるなんだろうなあ","ts":"1635475682.023000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B8md"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4986fc42-e826-489d-b44e-c179c93beebd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"きびしいw\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/tatsuosakamoto/status/1453893302294511618\u003e","ts":"1635474487.022200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/tatsuosakamoto|@tatsuosakamoto\u003e: まさか先日資金調達してエンジニア・マーケ・営業など全方位で採用中の投資先が、GAFAの一角とロゴが被るとは予想できなかったww\n1ヶ月前に作ったばっからしいww\n\nまさにHARD THINGS www \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FC1DQJ7aAAAD53U.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"坂本 \"MOLOCO\" 達夫","author_subname":"@tatsuosakamoto","author_link":"https://twitter.com/tatsuosakamoto/status/1453893302294511618","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1339836731281981440/to2YDyqL_normal.jpg","text":"まさか先日資金調達してエンジニア・マーケ・営業など全方位で採用中の投資先が、GAFAの一角とロゴが被るとは予想できなかったww\n1ヶ月前に作ったばっからしいww\n\nまさにHARD THINGS www \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FC1DQJ7aAAAD53U.jpg\u003e","image_url":"h