nal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xfI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FE596E3A-EEE0-4AE9-AE94-3DE85904FB2A","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"実際インターネットに出てこないエンジニアに聞いたらHasuさんと同じ気持ちのシニアなエンジニアもいそう。","ts":"1635465008.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VDnMQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3634f91b-802c-455b-9c21-7a0e762307ae","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"(歳とってから罹患するとクッソこじらせるところも含めて)","ts":"1635464947.002100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rOBo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ee2d23c-7a0a-4117-834a-0d3ee47e0821","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"身も蓋もないことをいうと、こういうのは一種のハシカ、多くの人がかかる厨二病みたいなものよ。","ts":"1635464744.001600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O8Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DDF81999-500E-445B-921A-943CFAC95FD5","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"コードはまあ気にすること現実にあまりないかなあ\n絵だと海外で勝手にグッズにされてたりヤバいけど","ts":"1635464698.001200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tS4Z0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28bdfb51-b828-4957-aca7-8892721b850b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"OSS文化で育ったので還元しておきたい気持ちがある","ts":"1635464686.000500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"850b63e6-54bb-40cd-8739-66e0f3263ab3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私は(そんな価値があるのかは別にして)自分の書いたコードなんてパクってなんぼだと思ってるので緩いライセンスにしている","ts":"1635464667.499300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZfUZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326261e8-c5e8-4fd4-b5da-3c777bb2d667","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ普通の人ならそんな気にするまでもないわな。","ts":"1635464416.496800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uw8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"981ecf1d-2c08-477a-8709-0ad88221269a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"言ってないことを言ったことにされる方の話ね。","ts":"1635464406.496500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pnKS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35d54337-e045-4c91-8fb6-78797f75f475","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"上にも書かれてた","ts":"1635464384.496100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9dl0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98c3d759-39b3-41ad-9a96-4f0cd3c9d26b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"偽物が出てくるくらい有名になれたら、それはそれで公開してるコードがコピーされた程度では痛くもかゆくもなかろう。\n\n著作人格権を侵されるほうが痛いか。","ts":"1635464380.495800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0","U8CC7MDCL","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/m="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fad0bb04-937e-4a5c-a500-22b95b648ea5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"物ってある程度は似る物なので気にしすぎてもしょうがないと思うけどね","ts":"1635464376.495700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AqQA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B4B0AEFC-6567-4B1C-970C-C1DC3D02A7CA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"簡単に役割を整理すると、\n\n• 著作権 → オリジナルコンテンツの無断複製を守ってくれる。勝手に発生するので、特に何もしなくて良い\n\n• 特許 → 発明。登録制で、未公開のもののみ申請可能。著作権と違って、アイデアだけでも登録できる。\n• ライセンス → 著作権や特許をもつものを他人に利用してもらうときのルール。ルールを破ると著作権、あるいは特許ライセンス違反\nって感じです","ts":"1635464243.493200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p3z4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d2a28b7-fb61-4a10-a3be-0e6427bfe811","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"現代においては唯一性は容易に偽装できるから、そこ気持ちはわかるけど拘ってても意味ないのよ。","ts":"1635464238.493100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZnO7A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F0DCF091-B65B-4F9B-A5FA-AEC72ADAE624","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それはライセンスで防御はできないですね。\nライセンスはあくまで自分が著作権を持つものを、他人が利用することを認めるためのもので、ライセンスがなければ、そもそも利用しちゃダメってことになります。\nあと、無断コピー（ライセンス違反を含む）されたときの対応は自分でしないといけなくて、相手に無視された場合は、なんらかの法的対処を自分ですることになります。","ts":"1635463788.486900","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1635465143.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PoR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa40ec14-65f4-467c-ba49-42185f676897","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やっぱりライセンスを学ぶしかないか","ts":"1635463223.480500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wf/g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f023dcd1-6322-4932-ad30-46e4fc3ad56d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ただ、これはライセンスをきちんとすれば防げるな","ts":"1635463213.480200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bw56"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b965afd-07bc-4073-80e9-84f3d6c9981e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まさにこれですね。\u0026gt;唯一性を失ないたくない","ts":"1635463199.479700","thread_ts":"1635462429.472700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e0b"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"25042dac-ca3e-4f74-8fce-918b49748245","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ソースコード(含むWebページの構成)の公開はいいけどページの中身のプロダクトと言うか著作物のコントロールと唯一性は失いたくない、みたいな？","ts":"1635462429.472700","thread_ts":"1635462429.472700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TOA"}]}},{"c